| T | Certification | Consecutive pair transitions and relative-chirality alternation in the specified Fibonacci-family linearized model. Standard phyllotaxis mechanism, not novel physical selection. | Section 5.2 proof; 49 exact algebra controls in `python code/verify.py` | Independent referee assessment recorded below. |
