    58	3. **Hyun-Woo Lee, Leonid S. Levitov.** “Universality in Phyllotaxis: a Mechanical Theory.” Chapter in *Symmetry in Plants*, World Scientific (1998), posted as [arXiv:2101.02652](https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.02652) (2021). [Full text](https://arxiv.org/html/2101.02652). Introduction and Sections II.1–II.2 read, including the explicit non-global-minimum qualification. This is the strongest directly relevant warning against conflating energetic evolution with global minimization.
