    49	
    50	A global basin-hopping search cannot strengthen the existing strict counterexample to the fixed ansatz; finding the unrestricted finite optimum is unnecessary to disprove it. The highest-value next action is to specify the actual Ag/silica elastic functional and growth constraints, then compare a relaxed Fibonacci-contact state against a seam-bearing crystal at the experimental cone angle. Without those assumptions, answering the broader book question from generic Riesz optimization would substitute a different physical problem.
